        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2507.00980">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2507.00980">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2507.00980">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
